# Mobile Table → Card Pattern

**Rule:** Every data table in the app MUST have a card-based fallback for mobile (below `sm` breakpoint). Never show a horizontal-scrolling table on mobile — render each row as a card instead.

## Pattern

Use `hidden sm:block` on the table wrapper and `sm:hidden` on the card list:

```tsx
{/* ── Desktop: table ── */}
<div className="hidden sm:block rounded-xl border overflow-hidden" style={{ borderColor: "var(--color-border)" }}>
  <table className="w-full text-sm">
    <thead>…</thead>
    <tbody>
      {items.map((item) => (
        <tr key={item.id}>…</tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

{/* ── Mobile: card list ── */}
<div className="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:hidden">
  {items.map((item) => (
    <div
      key={item.id}
      className="rounded-[10px] border p-4 space-y-2"
      style={{ background: "var(--color-surface)", borderColor: "var(--color-border)" }}
    >
      {/* Top row: primary identifier + status badge */}
      <div className="flex items-center justify-between">
        <span className="font-semibold text-sm" style={{ color: "var(--color-text-primary)" }}>
          {item.name}
        </span>
        <StatusBadge … />
      </div>

      {/* Secondary fields as label/value pairs */}
      <div className="text-xs space-y-1" style={{ color: "var(--color-text-muted)" }}>
        <div className="flex justify-between">
          <span className="uppercase tracking-wide font-medium">Email</span>
          <span>{item.email}</span>
        </div>
        <div className="flex justify-between">
          <span className="uppercase tracking-wide font-medium">Role</span>
          <span>{item.role}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Action buttons */}
      <div className="flex gap-2 pt-1">
        <button …>Edit</button>
        <button …>Deactivate</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  ))}
</div>
```

## Rules

- Cards use `var(--color-surface)` background and `var(--color-border)` border — **never hardcoded hex**
- Card `border-radius` is `10px` (matches the design system card token)
- Label text inside cards: `11px / uppercase / letter-spacing: 0.06em` in `var(--color-text-muted)`
- Primary field (name/title) is always at the top of the card in `font-semibold`
- Status badges and action buttons carry over from the table version unchanged
- Skeleton loaders on mobile: replace card content with `animate-pulse` placeholder divs, same card shell
- Empty state: single centered card with the same empty message as the table

## Do's & Don'ts

- ✅ `hidden sm:block` for table, `sm:hidden` for card list — always both together
- ✅ Cards are self-contained — all the same data as the table row, just stacked vertically
- ✅ Action buttons stay at the bottom of each card
- ❌ Never use `overflow-x-auto` as the mobile solution — cards only
- ❌ Never hide important columns on mobile — cards show everything
